* First: Suspend all gatherings or gatherings such as weddings, parties or all kinds of religious gatherings, etc. From today until December 16, 2020.
* Second: No more than 20 people are allowed to gather if necessary, but this meeting must maintain a social safety distance of at least 1.5 meters from each other.
