* Fifth, to inspect and monitor the implementation of measures to temporarily suspend some business locations, such as gymnasiums, KTV cinemas, entertainment clubs (bars, karaoke, discotheque, beer garden), massage business, health and grass.
* 7th: Call on the people in case it is not necessary not to travel outside the house. In case of unavoidable need, there should be no accumulation of traffic lights (traffic lights) in Phnom Penh.
8th: The 14 Khan administrations and relevant departments and units under the supervision of the Phnom Penh Capital Administration shall suspend all meetings from now until December 16, 2020. For public service facilities, it is necessary to have the temperature, mask, hand wash, disinfection and seating distance of 1.5 meters from one person to another, limiting the number of people who come to receive services not to exceed 20 people at a time.
* 9th: For public and private markets, heat measurement, mask and hand washing, disinfection must be arranged, and social safety gaps must be strictly implemented.
