3. In the decision-making meeting, the chairman of the commune council banned the LDP party from using the phone twice, but the party representative refused to listen to the instructions, which caused a mess.
"Therefore, Trapeang Phlong commune hall believes that the allegations made by the LDP representatives are incorrect because the commune councils have followed the principles, regulations and procedures of the National Election Committee (NEC). "The posting on social media of the party representatives is detrimental to the honor and dignity of the authorities." This is according to the clarification letter of Trapeang Phlong commune hall.
