NASA this week confirmed that the mysterious object orbiting the Earth was actually a 54-year-old rocket, not an asteroid. This is according to the release by CNA on the evening of Thursday, December 3, 2020.
The expert's suspicions were confirmed after the use of a telescope this week in Hawaii for verification and the discovery that it was indeed a Centaur rocket. It entered orbit around Earth last November and came close to Earth about 50,000 kilometers a few days ago.
The rocket will leave the orbit near Earth in March 2021 and return to its orbit around the Sun before returning to Earth in 2036.
