Samdech Techo, Head of the Royal Government, added, "The Great Victory of January 7, 1979 ended the darkest period ever in the history of Cambodia, ushered in a new era, and the Cambodian people regained their rights, freedoms and opportunities." To restore and rebuild their homeland. ”
It should be noted that the United Front for the National Salvation of Cambodia, now known as the "National Council of the United Front for the Development of Motherland Cambodia", was established on December 2, 1978 and issued its 11 B statements in the Snuol Liberation Area. Snoul district, Kratie province.
