(Phnom Penh): December 2, 2020 is the 42nd anniversary of the Khmer Patriots led by Samdech Chea Sim, Samdech Heng Samrin and Samdech Hun Sen gathered to fight for national liberation and the people from the genocidal regime. The brutal Pol Pot.
On the birthday of the national liberation movement and the people who came out of the grave of the Pol Pot regime, a friend of Fresh News wrote 15 poems describing the atrocities of the Pol Pot regime and commemorating the heroism of the patriots in the liberation struggle. Nation, people and build a prosperous country as it is now.
The following is the full meaning of the poem entitled "Cambodian National Journey":
1: Foreigners hate each other, there is no fire, but the smoke blows until it burns on March 18, the monkey holding the white trigger turns gray because of the coup.
2: Raising the fire to become a blazing eye, shouting for the Buddha, the sky, the rain, the rain, O God, change the habits, the sky, the rain, the rain, the land of Khmer.
3: 17 April that changed and the Khmer clearly recovered from the bomb, but on the contrary, the Khmer began to divide, cracked, torn, shouting enemies, shouting friends.
4: My motherland, wearing a black shirt, living under the direction of the organization, rights inferior to animals, great society, great leaping, eating together.
5: God, cement, monks, children of the villagers, why are they not happy to do the work of decapitating the donkey pagoda and the abbot turning the school into a prison.
6: June 20, the year of the Seventh Century, the Savior dared to take his life instead, decided to quarrel with the black-shirt regime.
8: December 2, eight angels wish the Khmer children to stand up, save the war this time to cross the gorge and lead the Khmer people to escape from the black planet.
9: 7 January, great success, the second day of the new moon, Brahma applauded, giving flowers everywhere, that Khmer is alive.
10: This birth took place in the ashes of buildings, ruined buildings, no roads, bridges, corpses scattered all over this road and remnants of the war.
11: One hand builds one hand protects, strives to restore all areas, even empty hands must be processed, save day and night to be careful.
12: 23 October: Peace on foreign paper declares success and all Cambodians stop quarreling and Cambodia is ninety-one years old.
13: Twenty-nine December, the eighth year, men and women applauded politics, win, win, not false, this is really the day that Cambodians are waiting for.
14: Politics wins, wins all, Khmer people, you are meek, you are straight, Barmi Techo helps to correct the struggle, focus on the path of prosperity.
15. This peace is worth life, we should try to preserve, protect, change, build a new monarchy and religion.
Under the first phase of the agreement, signed in early January last year, China agreed to increase purchases of goods and services from the United States by at least $ 200 billion between 2020 and 2021. But the deal also maintains a 25 percent tariff on $ 250 billion worth of Chinese goods, prompting China to repay by raising tariffs on US products worth $ 100 billion.
According to Joe Biden, the best way to deal with China is to work with US allies. He added that he would continue to pursue policies against Chinese trade misconduct, including piracy and forcing US companies to transfer technology to Chinese companies.
