Mr. Phan Chanthul stated that the Royal Government of Cambodia, with Samdech Techo Hun Sen as the Prime Minister, has made efforts to call for partners and philanthropists to help solve and rescue the victims in a timely, highly effective and practical manner. There is also the support and cooperation of Caritas in Cambodia.
