According to Duke Pung Kheav Se, Cambodians of Chinese descent overseas hope that the small amount of money raised from this fundraiser will help alleviate the hardships of the Cambodian people affected by the floods. I firmly believe that under the wise leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the lives of the people affected by the floods will return to normal soon.
The generous fund came to Cambodia on November 23, 2020 and was handed over to Samdech Techo Hun Sen's cabinet on November 27, 2020.
It should be noted that the floods in 2020 have seriously affected nearly 150,000 Cambodian families in 20 capitals and provinces. To solve the difficulties of the Royal Government and the affected people, many philanthropists have donated money to Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
According to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the budget of the philanthropist who contributed to solving this flood was more than 8 million dollars and spent more than 6 million dollars, leaving about 1,600,000 US dollars.
