(Koh Kong): The Koh Kong Provincial Administration has organized a lottery to end the impact of a land dispute between residents and a sugarcane development project that has been in dispute for many years in Chik village, Chik Leu commune, Sre Ambel district, Koh Kong province. Completed on November 26, 2020.
