Related to this point, the people who received compensation from the Royal Government after drawing the lottery lot thanked the Royal Government for their efforts to find a win-win solution for them until they received a title deed to them. Legal use and so on.
A group of Chinese nationals were arrested by the police in Prey Nup district on suspicion of kidnapping and using fake license plates.
(Sihanoukville): A group of four Chinese nationals were arrested by the Sihanoukville Provincial Police on suspicion of kidnapping and using fake license plates.
Preah Sihanouk Provincial Police Commissioner Major General Chuon Narin said that the Prey Nup District Administrative Unity Force led a force to inspect national weapons, explosives and drugs in Trapeang Kea village, Cheung Ko commune, Prey Nup district, Preah Sihanouk province until midnight. On November 26, 2020, inspected a white Star Rich car with license plate Phnom Penh 2BC-6802 driven by 4 Chinese people.
At the same time, Major General Chuon Narin also confirmed the operation to crack down on another case related to the illegal use and possession of weapons by the Chinese.
He stated that at 3:00 AM on November 27, 2020, a villager called to report that a Chinese national was standing in a quiet place at Otres point in Village 6, Sangkat 4, Sihanoukville with suspicion. Immediately after receiving the information, the criminal police task force arrived at the scene and found a Chinese suspect, as reported by residents.
