(Phnom Penh): Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross, would like to express his deep gratitude to the Malaysian Embassy in the Kingdom of Cambodia for donating 16 items of food to the Cambodian Red Cross for the operation to help vulnerable people. The worst after the rapid floods in 2020.
