(Phnom Penh): The magnificent five-star hotel Hayat Regency Phnom Penh, which has been invested nearly 180 million dollars (both construction cost and location) by Chip Mong is ready to open its doors to welcome national and international customers soon This is to contribute to the tourism, hospitality as well as business.
