The meeting also reviewed and approved some important documents of MRC such as: Basin Development Strategy 2021-2030 and Strategic Plan 2021-2025, Environmental Management Strategy, Navigation Master Plan, MRC Work Plan for 2020-2021 and Work Statute for Post Executive Director of the MRC Secretariat, who will be selected from Laos for a three-year term from 2022 to 2024.
