Hun Many, Member of Parliament and President of the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia, the world's first and youngest Cambodian elite, received this amazing award on November 25, 2015.
The leaders and members of the Medical Union of the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia consider it a matter of great pride that one of Cambodia's outstanding young people, a symbol of Cambodian youth throughout the country, has brought our beloved homeland to the international stage. The fame and notoriety of Hun Many through his many achievements and merits is invaluable.
The leaders of the members of the Medical Union of the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia, who are the leaders, members of the National Union of Physicians of the Union of Youth, Health Ambassadors and Advisory Councils, joined in greeting and congratulating. Congratulations to Mr. Hun Many on the 5th anniversary of receiving this great award, which is a great honor of Cambodia and all Cambodians.
The leaders and members of the Medical Union of the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia wished him and his wife, as well as their sons, daughters and family, the best of luck in the four Buddhist blessings: age, class, happiness, and strength.
