Samdech Techo Hun Sen to Attend the Opening Ceremony of the 17th ASEAN-China Expo on November 27
(Phnom Penh): The Prime Minister of Cambodia Samdech Techo Hun Sen will attend the opening ceremony of the 17th ASEAN-China Expo on November 27, 2020 via video. This is according to the press release of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation on November 25, 2020, obtained by Fresh News.
The Ministry of Foreign Affairs stated that the exhibition, organized under the theme "Building the Belt and Road and Strengthening Digital Economic Cooperation", will focus on promoting regional economic recovery after the Kovid-19 crisis and Maintaining the momentum of deepening cooperation between ASEAN and China.
Samdech Techo will also speak about Cambodia's efforts to promote digitalization of industrial production, services and public administration, as well as the implementation of drastic reform measures to improve the business and investment environment.
