(Phnom Penh): Mr. Khuong Sreng, Governor of Phnom Penh, and Lt. Gen. Thet, Deputy Commissioner General and Commissioner of Police of Phnom Penh Capital City, presented incentives to Daun Penh District Police for successfully cracking down on drug offenses in the past.
