The villagers raised 6 challenges and questions, 3 of which were solved by the Chairman of the Provincial Council and the Provincial Governor, and provided 3 communication radios to the people of Tonle Nam Village and 1 million Riels for rehabilitation. Repair the road from Ang Chote pagoda to Doeum Po village, Champey commune and help build 2 houses for 2 families who burned down on the 16th in Khvav village, Champey commune.
In the other 3 cases, the forum agreed to clarify by the department, the remaining cases, the provincial administration will review, discuss and resolve through various mechanisms to meet the needs of the people.
As a result, a total of 24 requests, of which 2 cases were resolved, provided $ 5,000 for the resolution of 68 families and 3.5 million for the removal of 3,500 meters of narrow roads and 22 In addition, the provincial administration will review the technical study and resolve it according to various mechanisms according to the actual needs of the people.
