Key remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the occasion of meeting with "Samdech Techo Sen Volunteer Lawyer"
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on November 25, 2020, met and inspected the work of "Samdech Techo Sen Volunteer Lawyer". The ceremony took place at the Peace Palace.
"Samdech Techo Sen Volunteer Lawyer" was established by Samdech Techo Hun Sen in February 2019 with the aim of helping to protect women who are poor and do not have access to legal protection. "Samdech Techo Sen Volunteer Lawyer" is chaired by Mr. Ky Tech and has a total of 138 members in all capitals and provinces.
During the meeting with "Samdech Techo Sen Volunteer Lawyer", Samdech Techo Hun Sen delivered the following 3 hours of keynote speech:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the November 3 event in Mondulkiri and Preah Vihear was over.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to call for respect for measures to prevent Kovid 19 and to live in Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he voluntarily accepted the criticism of Samdech for not wearing a mask.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on the Hungarian Minister of Foreign Affairs and Trade not to be blamed because he is a good friend of Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that it is a matter of pride to manage and successfully close the November 3 event through an immediate and effective response.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked all stakeholders for their efforts in closing the November 3 event.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the fight against Kovid 19 does not depend entirely on developed countries or countries with strong health systems, but on the management and control of the Kovid 19 situation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen noted that people are no longer interested in wearing masks after Samdech announced the end of the November 3 event.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he will use three planes to transport masks and medical equipment to Myanmar tomorrow.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he did not care about criticizing Samdech for providing mass aid and medical equipment to Laos and Myanmar. Samdech Techo stated that this is a contribution to help humanity and friendly countries.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech is also ready to provide some mass aid and medical equipment to East Timor.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is not just humanitarian in terms of mass and medical equipment, but Cambodia has carried out humanitarian activities, both flesh and blood, through peacekeeping missions under the auspices of the United Nations.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen recalled his humanitarian gesture to allow the Vermaster in February. Samdech Techo rejected the claim that he did it to please the United States because he did not know that this ship belonged to the United States.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expresses his gratitude to Samdech Mey for sending a message to visit Samdech during the ceremony.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that this year, Cambodia is fighting in two directions at the same time: the story of Kovid 19 and the flood, which requires Samdech to intervene directly.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the intervention to solve the flood cost more than 10 million dollars.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the donations of philanthropists for the flood more than 8 million spent on flood relief and more than 1.6 million left.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech has ordered Senior Minister Kun Kim to inspect the needs of the people after the floods, such as damage to houses, and to intervene with the remaining donations.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his deep satisfaction with the joint efforts to solve the flood problem.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech is managing to buy food and other consumables back into the Royal Government's stockpile.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen commended the Royal Government's lawyers for their hard work and approval of the proposal to establish a proper letter of appointment for the Royal Government's lawyers.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the budget for the operation of the Royal Government's lawyers uses the national budget under the Office of the Council of Ministers.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also praised the team of volunteer lawyers Samdech Techo Sen who worked hard to help defend poor and disadvantaged women.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructed Mr. Ly Chantola, President of the Bar Association to make a clear report on the budget, mission and work report.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that a clear understanding of the law and the proper exercise of rights is essential for the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that due to the complexity of the legal system, it is difficult for people to understand and requires a professional lawyer in a democracy.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen asked the lawyers to help increase the legal awareness of the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the establishment of this group of lawyers can be considered as a reform of the judiciary in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that even if Samdech ceases to be the Prime Minister, Samdech's volunteer lawyers can still remain.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he was sworn in as a lawyer in 1997. Samdech Techo stated that Samdech has inherited the blood of a lawyer from his grandmother, and Samdech is looking at his grandson to see who has the blood to inherit as a lawyer.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the defamation suit of Samdech in France has been set until September 1, 2022. Samdech's complaint took more than 3 years.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen proposes to supplement the budget for the National Council of Cambodia for Women to reach 500 million Riels for 2021.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked a number of NGOs for sending lawyers to defend the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also expressed his frustration with some civil society organizations for inciting people to demonstrate through lawyers.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also suggested that the provision of defense lawyers should not only be for the poor, but also for the rich.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that it was a serious mistake by the lawyers to boycott the courtroom and lead to a postponement of the trial as he wanted to speed up the process. Samdech did not press the group of lawyers who boycotted this. But in the past, they have seen the defense team for Mr. Kem Sokha to boycott the courtroom.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen warns government lawyers and volunteer lawyers not to boycott their rooms during the trial.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen leaked that a journalist asked to join the CPP to be free from charges.
* Samdech Techo stated that the case could not be traded with joining the CPP, and many CPP officials were also imprisoned.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he wants to resolve grievances and disputes outside the judiciary, not related to interests in order to resolve them.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen sent a message that the legal process is still ongoing and there is no political dialogue. In other words, the law must be enforced.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia has no political conflict, only those who have a conflict with the law, and Cambodia has no political prisoners, only politicians who commit crimes.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen questioned why the US Democrats chose Joe Biden, almost 80 years old, as President of the United States because they could not find a young candidate.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that the words "Minister has not lost the smell of milk" in 1979 made Samdech try to learn and work gradually.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded Samdech Techo Sen's volunteer lawyer to hold on to the facts from his client before examining the legal body.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed outrage at a lawyer who said that breaking the voice of Mr. Ho Van about the order to hold a demonstration was unconstitutional.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the opposition has never valued and celebrated the success and achievements of the Royal Government. Samdech Techo said that Samdech did not care because millions of people saw it.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen seeks the understanding of officials and the armed forces who can not increase their salaries in 2021.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia does not have clear management, not just waste. Samdech Techo added that a commander-in-chief has a staff to make it easier to reform the budget.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed hope that the Cambodian economy will recover again in 2021.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Khmer King is the poorest king in the world, but he is a king with a great humanitarian spirit.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the money donated by the King and Samdech Mey, government officials and philanthropists to solve the problem of Kovid 19 totaled 40 billion Riels, equivalent to about 10 million dollars. These funds have not yet been spent.
