(Kampong Cham): General Professor Seng Phally, President of the Police Academy of Cambodia, and Mr. Un Chanda, Governor of Kampong Cham Province, this morning, November 23, 2020, at the National Police School, Region 2, Kampong Cham Province, closed the 14th generation of basic police vocational training. The second time, with the participation of generals, school management, national police teachers, officers and 203 winning police students.
