Currently, the Police Academy of Cambodia has been successful in fulfilling its duties through the efforts of the leadership of the National Police and all officials based on strategic plans, regulations, reform programs, adherence to the values. Its six are discipline, quality, professional ethics, responsibility, commitment and innovation under the slogan (together we build a quality culture).
The President of the Police Academy of Cambodia also praised and instructed the management of the National Police School Zone 2 to continue to fulfill its duties to achieve more success according to the plan and instructed all successful students to bring knowledge and skills. Use for the benefit of society with ethics, professionalism, good attitude, sense of responsibility and obey the law to become a good police officer.
