Together, we have sustained multi-sectoral participation in the response to HIV and AIDS from all national, international, development partners, civil society, the private sector, and especially the network of people living with HIV. At the national and sub-national levels, and in particular we have a single national strategic plan, a highly effective national monitoring and evaluation system.
