(Kampong Cham): The first day of the implementation of additional strict measures on heavy transport vehicles led by Senior Minister Sun Chanthol, Minister of Public Works and Transport, detained 29 overweight trucks along the national road. No. 60 in Romduol village, Kor commune, Prey Chhor district, Kampong Cham province.
The operation took place on November 16, 2020, with the participation of senior officials of the Ministry, the working group, the mobile scales and the relevant local authorities. The ministry team inspected 32 trucks carrying rice, potatoes, mango feed and rubber, and found 29 vehicles overweight, of which 26 vehicles were overweight from 5% to 20%; Three vehicles are overweight by more than 20%.
