General knowledge: Who invented the first science?
(World): Since the advancement of science, people have discovered many modern technologies and discoveries on earth and in the universe, but you know where science originated and who created it first. Some?
The Greek scholar Aristotle described nature and how it worked, unlike previous scholars. He was the first to use observation to describe the world around him. This is the first foundation of science.
However, there is still debate over whether Aristotle was the first to make science. Because he did not use scientific methods to explain what happened.
