(Kampong Chhnang): The oldest tree, the largest and tallest of many trees in the flooded forest area, this tree also has a trunk more than 2 meters in height, about 20 meters M and has branches growing in a flooded forest area near Tonle Sap Lake in Pluot Touk village, Pluot Touk commune, Kampong Leng district, Kampong Chhnang province.
From a distance, this tree is the tallest of the many flooded forest trees growing in the area. Passengers by boat or ferry pass by there, when they get near the tree, especially the old people always raise their hands to pray and pray for the well-being of everyone on the waterway because this tree has sacred powers. Which the locals have believed since ancient times.
Residents say that the flooded forest in this area is called the ghost forest, and this ghost forest has been called by the ancients since ancient times, because since ancient times, the people who lived here The rainy season flooded everywhere, leaving only the mounds of houses, so if there were no dead bodies for burial or cremation, all the dead in the villages should be placed on this tree. All.
So this tree from ancient times to the present, there are hundreds of corpses placed here, but for the past four years, most people live here, if there are dead people, they will be cremated at Wat Thnal Chheuteal, which is located in Plou Touk commune, Kampong Leng district. But some people still take the corpse and keep it on this tree, because this is the place where the corpse has been stored since ancient times.
He added that this is also a sacred shrine. Residents near and far pass here, always come to ask for happiness and prosperity, some of them also make money according to their respective revolutions, because around this ghost forest is near the road, boats and boats travel in and out every day. .
The old man said that here also happened miracles like ghosts. Some people do not dare to travel through this place at night because it is known to be very haunted and some people say that they have seen ghosts here, while driving a boat through here, suddenly there is a boat Passing in front makes the ferryman panic when he stops looking for the ferry but cannot find it.
