From 4 to 15 November 2020, the total number of tests analyzed was 3918 samples (of which 1741 were tested in the first time and 825 in the second time). The third test was 1352 samples). The results from the Institut Pasteur du Cambodge showed that 4 positive Kovid-19 virus patients were being treated at the Khmer-Soviet Friendship Hospital.
