Deputy Prime Minister Hor Namhong said that the Sihanoukville Special Economic Zone is a subsidiary of the Royal Government of Cambodia and the Government of the People's Republic of China, within the framework of President Xi Jinping's "Belt and Road" policy.
Mr. Hor Namhong said that Sihanoukville Special Economic Zone is very special, which is close to Sihanoukville International Port and is a locomotive for export-import of goods because Sihanoukville is the most important economic and tourism pole of Cambodia and Chinese companies. Many also came to invest in this city a lot.
