He also confirmed the three stone sources that the two stones that do not have a clear shape can be extracted when restoring the Siem Reap River. As for the temple sculpture, it is in 10 different pieces taken from Po Lanka pagoda and used to sharpen knives, but he asked to keep some and keep it under the throne if the government needs it when needed. He will gladly give.
