(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Interior this morning, November 12, 2020, continued the meeting to review and comment on the draft sub-decree on the qualification and status of the National Police of Cambodia. The meeting was chaired by Mr. Chan Ean and Mr. Bun Hun, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Interior.
