Samdech Techo Hun Sen's Mass Distributed to Poor People in Chbar Ampov District
(Phnom Penh): 30,000 masks donated by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, provided through Phnom Penh Capital Hall by Chbar Ampov District Administration led by Mr. Cheng Monira, District Governor, distributed to poor people. Living in communities across the district on the morning of November 12, 2020.
