We have a joint mission: to promote the participation of ministries, institutions, development partners, the private sector, civil society organizations, organizations for the disabled, and NGOs, including people with disabilities, to make the environment incapable of implementing their action plans. The quality of life of people with disabilities is sustainable. This is according to the view of Secretary of State Em Chanmakara.
