3. Review and comment on the draft law on the approval of the first protocol, amend the Comprehensive Economic Partnership Agreement between the Member States of the Association of Southeast Asian Nations and Japan.
4. Review and comment on the draft law on the approval of the protocol for the implementation of the 10th pledge under the ASEAN Framework Agreement on Services.
5. Review and comment on the draft law on the approval of the Investment Agreement under the Framework Agreement on Comprehensive Economic Cooperation between the Association of Southeast Asian Nations and the Republic of India.
