(Battambang): This Sunday morning, November 8, after participating in the distribution of more than 1,000 tons of rice seeds to more than 10,000 families affected by the flood, Senior Minister Kun Kim, Vice President and Secretary General of the Association. Veterans handed over 8 houses to the families of poor and needy veterans in Banang village, Sdao commune, Rattanak Mondul district, Battambang province.
The ceremony was accompanied by Mr. Ouk Khnouch, Deputy Secretary General of the Standing Committee of the Central Committee of the Veterans Association, Lt. Gen. Sam Oun, Deputy Commander of the Army, Commander of the 5th Army Division and Brigadier General Meas Sovann, Commander of the Royal Gendarmerie.
