The Supreme Court Chamber of the Extraordinary Chambers in the Courts of Cambodia (ECCC) has closed the case against O'An before the Extraordinary Chambers. Following the "Immediate Appeal against the Extinction of the Trial Chamber Case 004/2" by the International Co-Prosecutor, the Supreme Court Chamber settled the International Co-Prosecutor's arguments.
So far, five senior officials of the Khmer Rouge genocidal regime have been tried by the Khmer Rouge tribunal, including: Ieng Thirith, who died in 2013, Ieng Sary, who died in 2013, Nuon Chea died in 2019, Kaing Guek Eav alias Duch died in September 2020 and Ou An died on November 6, 2020.
