(Prey Veng): On the morning of November 7, 2020, Mr. Kao Thach, Royal Government Delegate in charge of the Director General of the Bank for Rural Development and Agriculture, participated in a get-together with 200 vegetable farmers in Prey Veng and Svay Rieng provinces. People.
This program is organized and coordinated by Khmer Safe Vegetable Company and Prey Veng Provincial Department of Agriculture.
Taking this opportunity, Mr. Kao Thach thanked the vegetable farmers who took the time to participate in this morning's program.
The Director General informed the farmers about the policy and conditions for obtaining a loan with a low interest rate of 5% per annum for farmers to grow vegetables, raise animals, raise fish and so on.
Mr. Kao Thach encourages farmers to contact the Rural Development Bank and Agriculture in case there is a need for credit to expand cultivation.
Encourage farmers to select seeds for planting and to grow vegetables, to have a proper planting plan to supply the market regularly. Here, he stressed that in the past, people planted without a plan, causing a lot of losses or unprofitable due to inconsistent market supply. Sometimes the products grown in the market cause prices to fall.
Mr. Kao Thach gave practical examples as well as some arguments for the farmers to have a basis to consider. He asked them to change their farming habits from farming to entrepreneurship, to commercialization, supply to the market with quality, safety and sustainability. As a result, your life will change and prosper.
Taking this opportunity to reassure the farmers, the Director General introduced the Khmer Safe Vegetable Company, a vegetable wholesaler, so that they could sign a contract to do so to ensure market clarity. But he urged you to strengthen the quality of cultivation, respect the hygiene standards as well.
The Director General thanked the Provincial Department of Agriculture for co-providing the venue for the event. In addition, to facilitate travel expenses, the Director General has donated some money to vegetable farmers from Svay Rieng and Prey Veng provinces.
Phnom Penh Department of Social Affairs pays social security to 21 families of veterans from 10 districts
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of November 7, 2020, Ms. Mom Chandani, Director of the Department of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation of Phnom Penh and Permanent Deputy Director of the Cambodian Veterans Association of Phnom Penh, paid a one-time social security and cremation allowance. First to 21 families of veterans from 10 districts in Phnom Penh.
According to Ms. Mom Chandani, in accordance with the policy of the Royal Government, today, the Capital Department of Social Affairs has learned to hold a get-together with the families of the veterans and bring 168,575,040 Riels to 21 families of the veterans.
This is the 16th time that the team has visited the relatives' homes to find out about the well-being of the families of the veterans.
In particular, this 16th time, according to the instructions of Minister Vong Soth, instructed the Provincial Department of Social Affairs to provide services to the needs and efforts to make a policy regime to provide for the families of veterans.
Regarding the recommendation of the leadership, how to take care of you, that is, the Royal Government does not throw the family of veterans who you have a national merit through the Ministry of Social Affairs, Veterans, by resolving the monthly policy regime The policy for retired members until the death of each veteran member, in particular for the death of a veteran member, is to establish a policy to support the family.
Obviously, like today, the department has prepared the policy according to the rank, the level according to the sub-decree and the special instruction according to the instruction of the Minister, to make it faster and more efficient.
On behalf of the Minister of Social Affairs, Ms. Mom Chandani expressed her condolences on the loss of family members who died as veterans, we have contributed our lives to the cause of liberation and territorial integrity. Until the past success.
Ms. Mom Chandani emphasized that the heroic example of Cambodian veterans was indeed written in the history of the next generation of Cambodian children to express their gratitude to the previous generation. At the same time, the President prayed for the souls of the Cambodian ancestors who Sacrifice in the cause of the motherland, please go to death, do not waste it.
Acting Head of State sends congratulatory message to Samdech Mey on receiving the "Friendship of the People's Republic of China" medal from Xi Jinping
Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum wrote in his congratulatory letter: "Receiving the" Friendship of the People's Republic of China "(Samdech Mey) Medal is a national pride and a great honor of all Cambodians. "
The Chinese government has decided to confer the title "Friendship of the People's Republic of China" on Queen Norodom Monineath Sihanouk, the Queen Mother of Cambodia for Freedom, Dignity and Happiness. The official award ceremony was held on November 6, 2020 at the Great Hall of the People in Beijing, China.
Mr. Xi Jinping was the one who invited to present this award directly to the Queen Mother of Cambodia.
This afternoon, the King and Queen Mother will return to Cambodia after a month of medical check-ups in Beijing.
(Phnom Penh): His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, King of the Kingdom of Cambodia, and Her Majesty Queen Norodom Monineath Sihanouk, the Queen Mother of Cambodia, pay their last respects on the afternoon of November 7, 2020. Will return to Cambodia after a month of medical treatment and examination in Beijing, China.
It should be noted that the King of Cambodia and the Queen Mother of Cambodia visited for the second time for medical treatment and health examination for 2020 in Beijing, China on October 6. During the visit, the King of Cambodia paid a courtesy call on Chinese President Xi Jinping in Shanxi Province.
In addition to paying a state visit to Shanxi Province, on November 6, 2020, he also met with Chinese President Xi Jinping and his wife, as well as other senior Chinese officials. Great People's Palace of China.
The royal ceremony was held with great pomp and ceremony at the Great Hall of the People of China. This medal is a testament to the efforts of the Queen Mother of Cambodia, who carried out many royal activities to promote relations and cooperation between Cambodia and China.
The Queen Mother of Cambodia also expressed her willingness to work for the betterment of Cambodia-China relations. "I will continue my efforts to strengthen Cambodia-China relations," she said.
Mr. Aun Porn Moniroth, Representative of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, will attend the 37th ASEAN Summit and Related Summits via Video from November 12-15
(Phnom Penh): Dr. Aun Porn Moniroth, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Economy and Finance, representing Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, will attend the 37th ASEAN Summit and related summits, which will be televised today. 12th to 15th November, 2020. This is according to the press release of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs on November 7, 2020, obtained by Fresh News.
Accompanying Deputy Prime Minister Aun Porn Moniroth in the meeting were Dr. Hang Chuon Naron, Minister of Education, Youth and Sports, Prof. Mam Bunheng, Minister of Health, Dr. Ing Kantha Phavi, Minister of Women's Affairs and Mr. Say Sam Al, Minister of Environment and Senior Officials. High of some Royal Government of Cambodia as well.
