Samdech Techo Prime Minister Hun Sen and Deputy Prime Minister Prak Sokhon expressed their deepest condolences to their counterparts for their absence from these important events as they were in isolation for 14 days. Defined as a restriction of the National Regulations on Health Safety against Kovid-19.
"Today is the fourth day of meditation for my wife and me. In living alone in the room for the past 4 days, my wife and I, especially myself, did not see any abnormal signs, it was normal as before November 3, 2020. However, I have to continue to have a catheterization and tests as prescribed by the health department.
On November 9, 2020, the doctor will take a sample for a second test, which I hope will continue to be negative.
Taking this opportunity, I would like to call on the nearly 900 people directly or indirectly involved in the visit of the Hungarian Foreign Minister to continue to conduct a thorough examination and testing in accordance with the instructions of the Ministry of Health. "Thank you to all my compatriots who are concerned about my health and wish me and my wife as well as my colleagues."
