Mr. Thong Khon ordered the Baray and Tang Kork district party working groups to speed up the repair of roads and distribute rice seeds to farmers for further cultivation.
(Kampong Thom): Mr. Thong Khon, Chairman of Baray and Taing Kork District Assistance Task Force, Kampong Thom Province, ordered local party working groups in both districts to work together to speed up the restoration and repair of roads damaged by floods. Both rice seeds and other crops must be prepared and distributed to farmers for further cultivation.
This recommendation was made during the monthly working meeting of the Cambodian People's Party with the party chairmen of Baray and Taing Kork districts, party chairmen in communes, villages and local party working groups in both districts on November 7, 2020 at Baray district.
After listening to the reports of the two district party presidents, Mr. Thong Khon made some recommendations related to the party's work as well as the work of restoring and repairing infrastructure systems that were damaged by floods in the past.
In that, he advised to work hard to participate in repairing infrastructure, roads, etc. that were damaged by floods. Must cooperate with the officials and experts who went to do this work in accordance with the instructions of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and President of the Cambodian People's Party.
He ordered the team to report clearly on the roads damaged by the floods. Mobilize people to participate in repairing slightly damaged roads, and if any roads are badly damaged, contact the Samdech Techo Machinery Team stationed at the 5th Hun Sen Development Center.
In addition, efforts must be made to locate the source of the red soil, prepare machinery and equipment to build the road damaged by the flood.
Regarding agricultural work, Mr. Thong Khon continued to advise the working group to pay attention to the distribution of rice seeds and other crops to people affected by the floods, while the provincial and district administrations and The Department of Agriculture is also preparing to distribute to the people in the future.
In the near future, he will bring Japanese agricultural companies to help promote vegetable cultivation in Kampong Thom province to promote the agricultural sector in the province to grow as well as increase additional income for local people.
Regarding the prevention of Kovid-19, the President instructed the party working group to continue to work to prevent the second wave of Kovid epidemic, implement safety measures in accordance with the guidelines of the Ministry of Health, while Cambodia as well as the whole world. Get rid of this vicious disease yet.
