(Pursat): On the morning of November 7, 2020, Lt. Gen. Hun Manet, Deputy Commander of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces and Commander of the Army, representing Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, distributed rice seeds to the people. Nearly 20,000 families in Pursat province.
