Lt. Gen. Chhay Kim Khoeun said that for the past 189 days, the implementation of the new sub-decree to fine vehicles for offenses has been going well. He thanked and commended all the road users for their good obedience to the traffic law so far, especially the traffic police for their dedication and hard work. Tighten traffic with the highest sense of responsibility.
Please note that for November 5, 2020, traffic accidents across Cambodia also occurred 9 times, in which 2 people died, 15 people were injured (9 people were seriously injured).
