"We have a joint mission: to promote the participation of ministries, institutions, development partners, the private sector, civil society organizations, organizations for the disabled, and non-governmental organizations, including people with disabilities, in order to provide a disabled environment in the implementation of their action plans," he said. To achieve a sustainable quality of life for people with disabilities.
