He said that the suspect was named Chhom Tak, 26 years old, living in Svay Pok village, Doung commune, Romeas Hek district, while the victim was named Toch Savan, 44 years old, a farmer living in Svay Pok village, Doung commune, Romeas Hek district. The suspect is currently being detained by the police for questioning at the Romeas Hek District Police Inspectorate for legal action.
