(Banteay Meanchey): Emergency food donations from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and President of the Cambodian Veterans Association, were distributed to 345 families of veterans, families of victims and flood victims from the city. 7 districts in Banteay Meanchey province.
