The visit to monitor the water condition to increase the means to accelerate the intervention activities to release the amount of flood water to flow into the Tonle Sap Lake, which is an immediate measure to reduce the impact on the crops in the Trapeang Thmor Reservoir system in the district. Phnom Srok, Banteay Meanchey Province and the lower part in Siem Reap Province.
At the same time, urgent measures have been taken for all provinces to pack water for future use.
